{"id":"velocidad","lemma":"velocidad","pos":"noun","rank":1047,"glosses":["speed","velocity","gear"],"ipa":"/beloθiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"velocidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-velocidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él corrió a toda velocidad","en":"He ran at full speed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455370"},{"text":"Tienes que reducir la velocidad.","en":"You need to slow down.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450715"},{"text":"No excedas la máxima velocidad.","en":"Don't exceed the speed limit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553736"},{"text":"¿Sabes a qué velocidad ibas?","en":"Do you know how fast you were going?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610001"},{"text":"La velocidad no lo es todo.","en":"Speed isn't everything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460912"}]}